# Fixtures are GENERATED (generate.py), never committed: the AstGen fan-out alone
# is 1,201 files and the self-host snapshot is 268 MB. Only the generator and this
# file are tracked. Belt-and-braces: the harness writes its fixtures to
# `build-vharness/fixtures/` (already gitignored by `build-*/`), so this rule is a
# second line of defence against an accidental `git add` of a generated tree.
*
!.gitignore
!generate.py
